WEBVTT

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.224
Charlie 2 reporting. Situation, normal.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.643
How about a drink when we get back?

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.144
Sounds good.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:21.730
I could go for some
grilled BRAI lizard liver.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:24.316
CAUTION
SYSTEM ERROR

00:02:10.714 --> 00:02:14.259
The Enemy Above

00:02:14.343 --> 00:02:15.427
What are you doing?

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:21.975
The accessing of multiple dimensions
puts tremendous stress on the hardware.

00:02:22.351 --> 00:02:25.729
If we're going to mass produce it,
I need to have the limiter be...

00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:30.359
You're violating the Family Contract.

00:02:32.611 --> 00:02:35.656
I thought we agreed
that snacking on mahua didn't count.

00:02:35.906 --> 00:02:39.159
Article 22, "Don't bring your work home!"

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.203
Oh, that one.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.122
Can't you leave that at the base?

00:02:44.665 --> 00:02:48.293
That new recruit, the really fussy one
gets angry about it.

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.879
He says,
"Don't leave that anywhere near me."

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:52.005
I wonder why.

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:54.674
<i>Leon. We've got work.</i>

00:02:57.052 --> 00:02:59.137
This thing really got hammered.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.681
Was it shot with a missile?

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:06.645
Doug, did you visit
an adult shop again last night?

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:10.607
Excessive consumption of alcohol can lead
to a reduction in physical capacity.

00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:15.028
There are plenty of other stimulants
at adult shops.

00:03:15.529 --> 00:03:16.696
"Stimulants"?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.281
Doug!

00:03:18.365 --> 00:03:19.616
So, what's it look like?

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:22.119
If it exploded in mid-air,

00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:25.288
the debris would be scattered
across a wider area.

00:03:25.747 --> 00:03:29.042
It looks more like it was ripped apart,
than hit by a missile.

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:47.519
So the culprit returns
to the scene of the crime?

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.648
It's not too late to turn yourself in.

00:03:52.774 --> 00:03:55.277
Her machine's arms couldn't do
something like this.

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:58.113
Come on man. Just play along, would you?

00:03:58.655 --> 00:04:00.115
If it was a BRAI,

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:03.243
I had better analyze
a cross section quick.

00:04:05.829 --> 00:04:08.498
But how was a transport plane
attacked in mid-air?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.086
What's the matter, miss?

00:04:13.462 --> 00:04:15.422
You look like you might have an inkling.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:16.923
I don't.

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:19.301
No need to get cross.

00:04:19.426 --> 00:04:20.594
Just leave me be.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.930
You'll be in Neo Xianglong for a while,
right?

00:04:24.723 --> 00:04:27.058
We're still looking for new recruits.

00:04:27.642 --> 00:04:30.061
You'll get no royal treatment,
but the pay is good.

00:04:31.188 --> 00:04:33.190
It's not money I'm after.

00:04:33.899 --> 00:04:35.734
Looks like we got rejected, commander.

00:04:36.359 --> 00:04:38.820
Not to worry. I've still got hope.

00:04:38.904 --> 00:04:41.698
Well, power to you.
Doesn't matter to me though.

00:04:43.575 --> 00:04:45.285
An attack from above?

00:04:48.497 --> 00:04:50.123
It wasn't a missile strike?

00:04:50.707 --> 00:04:53.460
<i>Analysis of the</i>
<i>transport plane's logs revealed</i>

00:04:53.835 --> 00:04:57.005
<i>that it was attacked at 12,000 meters.</i>

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:01.676
<i>That's far beyond the range</i>
<i>of any anti-aircraft missile.</i>

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:06.681
<i>Hey, Leon. Why don't you hold off</i>
<i>on the mahua for a while?</i>

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:11.144
He's always been like that,
snacking during class all the time.

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:13.021
So, what are you saying?

00:05:13.647 --> 00:05:15.398
<i>The attacker was most likely...</i>

00:05:16.066 --> 00:05:17.984
<i>a giant flying BRAI.</i>

00:05:18.693 --> 00:05:19.528
Giant?

00:05:20.195 --> 00:05:21.196
So, a birdie?

00:05:21.947 --> 00:05:26.284
<i>Normally, there's a limit to the weight</i>
<i>of flying animals.</i>

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:30.288
<i>An aerial BRAI large enough</i>
<i>to tear apart a transport plane</i>

00:05:30.497 --> 00:05:32.123
<i>defies the laws of physics.</i>

00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:36.127
<i>Could it have one of those</i>
<i>Dark Drives in it?</i>

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:42.008
<i>If so, it could be amplifying its lift by</i>
<i>dispersing it across multiple dimensions.</i>

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:45.804
<i>Their evolution is far beyond</i>
<i>what we imagined.</i>

00:05:46.888 --> 00:05:51.685
<i>It's called the absolute-defense system,</i>
<i>but it's weak against attacks from above.</i>

00:05:51.935 --> 00:05:55.397
<i>I've said it before,</i>
<i>but your budget priorities are crazy.</i>

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.441
<i>-Shouldn't measures be--</i>
-You don't need to say it.

00:05:58.525 --> 00:06:00.652
Be prepared just in case it happens.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.905
They just keep coming.

00:06:04.406 --> 00:06:05.782
It never seems to stop.

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:08.827
<i>It's been a few years since</i>
<i>the BRAI appeared.</i>

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.996
<i>Due to the evolutionary fields,</i>

00:06:11.246 --> 00:06:13.665
<i>they've evolved at an astounding pace.</i>

00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:18.128
<i>It's as if they've undergone</i>
<i>several billion years of evolution</i>

00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:20.255
<i>all in a single bound.</i>

00:06:21.131 --> 00:06:23.300
<i>Only humans have been left behind.</i>

00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:26.803
Even if that's so, we still have to live.

00:06:27.596 --> 00:06:29.848
They're the ones that must be culled.

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:36.146
Whatever happens,
we cannot allow them to defeat us here.

00:06:39.608 --> 00:06:43.612
Since we put that in Forze,
his growth has been quite apparent.

00:06:45.655 --> 00:06:48.908
I hear they call
the multidimensional amplifier

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:52.078
that I developed the Dark Drive.

00:06:52.537 --> 00:06:56.291
It has great fusion compatibility
with living beings. Excellent!

00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:59.294
All that's left now is to
put it into practice, Mr. Gold.

00:06:59.878 --> 00:07:03.214
Let's go put on one sideshow
before that, Wang.

00:07:03.882 --> 00:07:06.801
A sideshow? That's not in my contract.

00:07:07.761 --> 00:07:08.928
Dissatisfied?

00:07:09.554 --> 00:07:11.973
I'm not your subordinate.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.359
There's a woman I must kill.

00:07:23.193 --> 00:07:24.319
Simple as that.

00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:27.364
Leave him be, Fau.

00:07:28.823 --> 00:07:32.994
Wang, what's the rush?
Your woman isn't going to run away.

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:37.582
In fact, if you lay a trap,
she'll jump into it for sure.

00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:40.585
That's the type of woman she is, right?

00:07:42.337 --> 00:07:43.880
<i>Hey, babe! Over here!</i>

00:07:44.172 --> 00:07:45.715
<i>Man, I'm tired!</i>

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:51.680
Even if it did attack from the air...

00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:54.641
Ta-da!

00:07:56.059 --> 00:07:58.103
Well, well. You've got a uniform?

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.355
Chloe Lau reporting.

00:08:00.605 --> 00:08:03.358
Starting today,
I will be Pandora's disciplinary officer.

00:08:03.817 --> 00:08:07.153
So, we're celebrating little sis
joining the squad today, huh?

00:08:07.821 --> 00:08:09.197
Captain Gren Din.

00:08:09.698 --> 00:08:12.409
Starting today,
I've been assigned to Pandora.

00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:14.661
I look forward to working with you.

00:08:14.911 --> 00:08:17.205
You're just an extra, kid.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.332
I'm not a kid! I'm a captain!

00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:22.460
Hey, Leon. Well? Do I look good in this?

00:08:22.752 --> 00:08:26.172
The current air-defense system
against flying...

00:08:26.965 --> 00:08:28.508
Get out of your own world!

00:08:28.717 --> 00:08:30.385
Family Contract, Article 28.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.471
"You must give a compliment
when new clothes are worn!"

00:08:36.933 --> 00:08:41.021
So delicious!
Oh, wow! This catfish is delicious!

00:08:41.396 --> 00:08:44.065
I invited
Secretary Jay and the Princess, too.

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:45.442
How kind of you.

00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:48.528
I didn't think you would come either.

00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:51.823
There just happens to be
a nice shop nearby.

00:08:52.157 --> 00:08:53.700
You sure have a lot of energy.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.703
Sky, bird, sky, bird...

00:08:57.328 --> 00:08:58.163
From above...

00:08:58.246 --> 00:09:00.999
Leon! Family Contract, Article 79.

00:09:01.207 --> 00:09:03.585
"Forget about work when you're eating!"

00:09:04.085 --> 00:09:05.920
Dang scientists...

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.882
Listen up, brainiac.

00:09:09.507 --> 00:09:12.969
The reason I couldn't control
that hyperdrive the other day

00:09:13.053 --> 00:09:15.388
was because of your shoddy maintenance.

00:09:15.472 --> 00:09:17.724
I swear I'll get the hang of it next time.

00:09:18.183 --> 00:09:21.978
Come to think of it,
why did you transfer to Pandora, Gren?

00:09:22.437 --> 00:09:25.482
To fight! For the sake Neo Xianglong!

00:09:26.149 --> 00:09:29.986
But you won't be a captain on our squad.
Just a regular grunt.

00:09:30.195 --> 00:09:33.364
My rank will still be captain,
you drifter!

00:09:33.698 --> 00:09:37.368
I think Sarge is more appropriate
for you, kid.

00:09:37.452 --> 00:09:38.828
Quit calling me kid!

00:09:39.079 --> 00:09:40.914
Don't get so upset, Sarge.

00:09:40.997 --> 00:09:43.458
Cut it out.
Do you want a Japanese pepper shower?

00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:44.667
Definitely not.

00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:48.838
If I smelled like that,
Emilia wouldn't come near me.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.299
Isn't that right?

00:09:52.967 --> 00:09:54.010
She dumped you.

00:09:54.385 --> 00:09:56.429
That's what I like about her.

00:09:57.388 --> 00:10:01.935
Maybe use the Earth's magnetic field
to disturb the bird's sense of direction?

00:10:02.227 --> 00:10:03.895
Or maybe block its vision?

00:10:24.499 --> 00:10:27.627
You must tame the dragon
that dwells within you.

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:32.632
Of heart, technique, and physique,
it's the one thing you lack.

00:10:49.149 --> 00:10:50.567
Sorry. It was a reflex.

00:10:50.984 --> 00:10:53.444
I'm sorry, too. My mind was elsewhere.

00:10:53.987 --> 00:10:56.114
Huh? What? Where am I?

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:01.911
So, you really are just an ordinary guy.

00:11:02.287 --> 00:11:03.121
Pardon?

00:11:03.663 --> 00:11:05.832
I saw you fight the other day.

00:11:06.958 --> 00:11:08.168
<i>The way you fought</i>

00:11:08.668 --> 00:11:10.170
<i>was truly godlike.</i>

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:13.756
I was strained to my limits though.

00:11:14.465 --> 00:11:17.427
But you still intend to rely
on that unknown power?

00:11:18.386 --> 00:11:19.721
I've seen it before.

00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:23.391
People who were obsessed
and consumed by power.

00:11:25.059 --> 00:11:28.271
Power that exceeds reason
is nothing more than madness.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:32.108
Are you prepared to forever
restrain that madness?

00:11:36.779 --> 00:11:42.785
I myself have been obsessed with power
so much that I once lost sight of myself.

00:11:43.828 --> 00:11:46.205
But I've changed since then.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.208
I have something to protect now.

00:11:50.209 --> 00:11:51.461
Something to protect?

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:56.174
Darn you! There you go
wandering off by yourself again!

00:11:56.257 --> 00:11:57.508
Sorry, Chloe.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.720
Today was fun too, wasn't it?

00:12:02.138 --> 00:12:03.598
Oh! Queenie!

00:12:04.515 --> 00:12:05.350
You seem well.

00:12:05.808 --> 00:12:07.185
Hey, little girl.

00:12:07.685 --> 00:12:09.562
Have you found Leon?

00:12:12.357 --> 00:12:14.192
Well, if it isn't you again.

00:12:15.193 --> 00:12:19.197
We just had some catfish.
These are delicious.

00:12:19.405 --> 00:12:20.657
She won't eat that.

00:12:22.784 --> 00:12:23.618
Thank you.

00:12:23.868 --> 00:12:24.953
Or will she?

00:12:26.746 --> 00:12:29.457
What are you outsiders doing?

00:12:29.874 --> 00:12:31.417
Looking real suspicious.

00:12:31.501 --> 00:12:32.794
You stink of alcohol.

00:12:33.127 --> 00:12:35.129
Kid, I told you to take a break.

00:12:35.213 --> 00:12:36.547
I'm not a kid!

00:12:36.631 --> 00:12:37.966
Fine. Then Sarge.

00:12:38.049 --> 00:12:40.259
I'm not a sarge either! I'm a captain!

00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:44.806
What? Are you running away?

00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:48.893
-Leave her alone.
-Hey! Stop! I told you to stop!

00:12:53.106 --> 00:12:54.232
Damn it!

00:12:54.899 --> 00:12:58.027
These people can't defend Neo Xianglong.

00:12:58.653 --> 00:13:00.530
You goddamn outsiders!

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:02.740
Stop it! Both of you!

00:13:03.825 --> 00:13:04.659
Queenie, no!

00:13:15.712 --> 00:13:18.047
See why I told you to leave her alone?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.591
Sorry about that.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.386
Still, you're pretty darn good.

00:13:24.345 --> 00:13:26.180
My master was stronger than me.

00:13:26.973 --> 00:13:27.974
Even so,

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.811
you can't defeat the BRAI
with your bare hands.

00:13:32.895 --> 00:13:36.441
Who are you anyway?
You say you're not after money, so...

00:13:36.983 --> 00:13:37.900
You see...

00:13:38.818 --> 00:13:40.528
there's a man I want to kill.

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:49.412
Dang! That gave me chills.

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:50.997
You're still after her?

00:13:51.622 --> 00:13:53.958
Now's when I show my true skills.

00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:56.461
I promise you, she'll come around.

00:14:16.397 --> 00:14:17.398
Enough!

00:14:22.737 --> 00:14:23.738
I'm not through.

00:14:25.323 --> 00:14:26.324
Queenie...

00:14:27.367 --> 00:14:30.078
Amazing. This is what I've been after.

00:14:51.599 --> 00:14:54.852
I'd say it's about time we settled this,
Queenie.

00:14:58.439 --> 00:14:59.982
Bogey spotted, 12 o'clock.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.651
This is Bravo Five.

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:04.904
Flying object approaching
from west-northwest at incredible speed.

00:15:05.321 --> 00:15:08.074
What? It disappeared!
I've lost visual contact!

00:15:08.783 --> 00:15:09.784
Impossible!

00:15:15.331 --> 00:15:17.500
Our air-defenses
are still under construction.

00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:20.044
If we allow it to infiltrate,
we'll be sitting ducks.

00:15:22.338 --> 00:15:23.339
He's here.

00:15:23.881 --> 00:15:26.467
<i>Launch gate, standby.</i>
<i>Launch gate, standby.</i>

00:15:43.067 --> 00:15:44.694
Is that... a falcon?

00:15:45.236 --> 00:15:47.572
OX Plaza No. 3 has been destroyed.

00:15:48.197 --> 00:15:49.282
OX Plaza?

00:15:49.657 --> 00:15:53.202
We're getting quantum readings.
They're coming from the BRAI itself.

00:15:53.369 --> 00:15:56.789
-I knew it. It's the Dark Drive.
-Damn it! What's the situation?

00:15:57.707 --> 00:16:00.168
To defend against an attack from above...

00:16:00.793 --> 00:16:01.919
<i>Here it comes!</i>

00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:04.255
<i>Got you!</i>

00:16:06.424 --> 00:16:08.926
Shit!
How can it move like that in the air?

00:16:09.135 --> 00:16:13.764
-I'm not getting paid enough for this!
<i>-Can you shoot it down if I double it?</i>

00:16:13.848 --> 00:16:18.186
<i>-No, I need five times as much.</i>
<i>-Whatever! Just blow that thing away fast!</i>

00:16:19.562 --> 00:16:20.730
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:16:21.272 --> 00:16:23.941
<i>Falcons are already</i>
<i>the fastest divers among birds.</i>

00:16:24.567 --> 00:16:27.695
<i>Due to the BRAI effect,</i>
<i>this one has far greater capabilities.</i>

00:16:28.488 --> 00:16:29.489
I'll go, too!

00:16:30.156 --> 00:16:31.157
It's pointless.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.368
Your MOEV doesn't stand a chance
against that advanced machine.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.747
<i>Damn overgrown chicken!</i>

00:16:38.039 --> 00:16:39.832
<i>It's like it's toying with us.</i>

00:16:40.166 --> 00:16:42.418
Shin-Xiaokoh Tower has been destroyed.

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:45.046
All of those buildings
are of low importance.

00:16:45.129 --> 00:16:46.130
Why?

00:16:46.297 --> 00:16:49.509
If it wanted to,
it could wipe out the entire city.

00:16:50.092 --> 00:16:51.093
I get it.

00:16:51.719 --> 00:16:53.638
All the buildings it's attacking

00:16:54.055 --> 00:16:55.389
belong to my family.

00:16:56.182 --> 00:16:59.477
You mean, the BRAI is intentionally
selecting targets?

00:16:59.894 --> 00:17:00.895
Impossible.

00:17:01.479 --> 00:17:03.564
That birdie seems to be...

00:17:04.357 --> 00:17:05.483
quite domesticated.

00:17:07.527 --> 00:17:08.444
Forze,

00:17:09.403 --> 00:17:12.156
you and I are linked as one.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:16.118
This is the ultimate strength
I've always desired.

00:17:17.245 --> 00:17:21.457
<i>Until now, the BRAI have been attracted</i>
<i>by the quantum reactor's energy.</i>

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.377
<i>But this time is clearly different.</i>

00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:27.255
<i>There must be someone controlling it.</i>

00:17:27.797 --> 00:17:28.839
Controlling it?

00:17:29.131 --> 00:17:31.634
We've had no reports of this kind of BRAI.

00:17:31.926 --> 00:17:33.261
How are they doing it?

00:17:33.719 --> 00:17:37.056
<i>They're likely using remote control</i>
<i>via multi dimensions.</i>

00:17:37.223 --> 00:17:39.976
<i>-That's what I would do.</i>
-How can that be done?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.561
At any rate,

00:17:41.978 --> 00:17:44.105
it appears that its target is me.

00:17:45.856 --> 00:17:48.401
I've spotted an annoying little insect.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.238
<i>Leon! Dodge!</i>

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:07.169
Ah, shit!

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.963
You alive, Mr. Scientist?

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:10.631
What about you, Doug?

00:18:11.132 --> 00:18:12.383
<i>This one is mine!</i>

00:18:12.967 --> 00:18:14.051
Don't interfere!

00:18:14.343 --> 00:18:15.344
The Kenpō master!

00:18:15.428 --> 00:18:16.387
Queenie!

00:18:19.056 --> 00:18:21.350
Wang! Quit hiding! Show yourself!

00:18:21.517 --> 00:18:24.562
<i>Queenie! Switch your canopy to smoke mode!</i>

00:18:30.693 --> 00:18:31.902
<i>You're blinding it?</i>

00:18:32.194 --> 00:18:36.032
Birds of prey have eight times as many
photoreceptors on their retinas as humans.

00:18:36.282 --> 00:18:37.325
<i>Good thinking.</i>

00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:45.958
<i>I missed?</i>

00:18:46.417 --> 00:18:50.296
-Then I'll just tear you to shreds!
-Queenie!

00:19:06.729 --> 00:19:08.356
It's been a while.

00:19:09.899 --> 00:19:12.693
Hao Wang, you've finally shown yourself.

00:19:13.903 --> 00:19:16.614
I've been wanting to see you, Queenie.

00:19:18.783 --> 00:19:19.700
I'll kill you!

00:19:20.618 --> 00:19:21.452
Queenie...

00:19:28.292 --> 00:19:30.670
You die here and now.

00:19:31.087 --> 00:19:32.505
Sounds like just talk to me.

00:19:32.588 --> 00:19:35.383
You'd better get serious,
or you'll be the one to die.

00:19:40.971 --> 00:19:43.516
Why did you kill Master and our friends?

00:19:43.891 --> 00:19:46.894
That's the way.
Show me more of what you've got.

00:19:47.269 --> 00:19:48.813
Show me your madness.

00:19:49.855 --> 00:19:52.608
Show me the raging beast inside you!

00:20:00.032 --> 00:20:03.202
Is that...
the man that was controlling the BRAI?

00:20:04.453 --> 00:20:07.665
As the same type of being as me,
you must understand.

00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:10.459
Madness is what makes a person strong.

00:20:11.711 --> 00:20:13.838
You strayed from the path somewhere.

00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:15.798
I thought we were friends

00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:18.801
who studied and forged ourselves
under our master!

00:20:19.135 --> 00:20:21.429
All I'm after is strength.

00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:26.308
Unfortunately, humanity will not evolve
any more than it already has.

00:20:31.689 --> 00:20:33.315
So, I have only one choice!

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:37.069
I must abandon all that is human about me.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.951
Our master wasn't prepared to do that.

00:20:44.827 --> 00:20:47.371
I'm the one who should feel
betrayed by him.

00:20:47.455 --> 00:20:48.497
Why, you...

00:20:49.415 --> 00:20:53.377
Queenie, why do you not desire
even greater strength?

00:20:57.131 --> 00:20:58.424
You're weak.

00:20:58.632 --> 00:21:00.301
So unbelievably weak.

00:21:14.774 --> 00:21:17.651
You've become quite the mundane woman.

00:21:21.822 --> 00:21:25.701
Perhaps letting you live back then
was a mistake.

00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:41.509
What did you say?

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.597
You've disappointed me.

00:22:07.743 --> 00:22:08.577
Queenie!

00:22:09.745 --> 00:22:11.747
Queenie!

00:23:46.842 --> 00:23:50.429
THE WINGS OF GRIEF AND REVENGE

00:23:50.512 --> 00:23:51.972
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
